<title>TAJIKISTAN: SOCCER-TAJIKISTAN BEAT TURKMENISTAN 5-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TAJIKISTAN BEAT TURKMENISTAN 5-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DUSHANBE 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tajikistan beat Turkmenistan</p>
<p>5:0 (4:0) in their World Cup Asian zone group eight qualifier on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Arsen Abakov 2, Shukhrat Dzhabborov 12, Arsen</p>
<p>Abakov 25, Arsen Abakov 33, Tokhirdzhon Muminov 88</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,000</p>
<p>    Final standings  P   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> China		   6   5   1   0  13   2    16</p>
<p> Tajikistan	    6   4   1   1  15   2    13</p>
<p> Turkmenistan	  6   2   0   4   8  13     6</p>
<p> Vietnam		 6   0   0   6   2  21     0</p>
<p>China qualify for second round.</p>
</text>
